legal/ethical umbrellas as universities, and both face similar
dilemmas in expanding computing services to meet the needs of an
ever-growing userbase.  I offered my comments as those of someone
who has been in the same boat; no offense or dictation was inten-
ded, and I apologize for any appearance of either.

